message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "energyml-rust: read, write and compute EnergyML data"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Geosiris"
    website: "https://www.geosiris.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/geosiris-technologies/energyml-rust"
url: "https://www.geosiris.com"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Rust library, a Python package and a command-line tool to read, write and
  compute EnergyML data (RESQML, WITSML, PRODML): EPC packages made of zip,
  XML and HDF5. Developed by Geosiris; not affiliated with or endorsed by
  Energistics or The Open Group.
keywords:
  - EnergyML
  - RESQML
  - WITSML
  - PRODML
  - EPC
  - HDF5
  - geoscience
